      "completion_evidence": "verification/TURN_148_CHANNEL_COMPLETION.json",
      "verified_scope": "ChannelRelation retains exact nonempty/unique carrier, duplicate relation cell, endpoint containment and totality checks in original error order. Empty string labels and unused output-carrier entries remain permitted. Native constructor iff and field identity.; Exact source filter and relation order, original outside-source error. Native support iff relation cell, admitted nonempty/inside/distinct output supports.; Original shared-output predicate with original source errors and nonempty/unique/covered held-code guards. Native shared-target iff, overlap symmetry, admitted self-confusability, exact code predicate characterization and pairwise disjointness.; ChannelSelections generates full positive-size combinations in increasing size and source-index order. Native exact length/subsequence iff, completeness and unique combinations/candidates. ChannelCapacity retains exact greatest length and all ties in source order, with native bound/attainment/family iff, nonempty admitted result, unique records and singleton-channel base. Raw empty-candidate maximum error preserved.; ChannelComposition retains ordered carrier equality, original nested relation traversal and first-occurrence deduplication. Native complete path iff, admitted totality and exact fields, and no restored distinction after merged intermediate support.; ChannelCapacity singletonCapacity gives original one-input base. ChannelExtension appends fresh input and exact ordered support; extensionAdmitted preserves original constructor conditions. oldSupport/newSupport/oldOverlap/freshOverlap retain all previous supports and add precisely the new overlap checks. priorCode/appendCode/appendCodePrior establish old-code preservation and extension iff all new pairs are disjoint. candidateAlternatives gives exhaustive old/singleton/extended candidates at every finite successor, without sampled depth.; Complete original1024 ten-axis product, exact source order/IDs/forms/reasons, exhaustive enumeration, criteria equivalence, unique survivor and coordinate rejection. Every actual source witness is computed through translated operations; three witness channels have native constructor proofs and all five witnesses pass. Laws, induction, exclusions and four controls retained.; Fresh full native program matches original registration/census/all1024 identifier-based lookups/closure/controls/all hashes/unknown-ID refusal. Original why/derivation/check/limitations/correspondence terms retained."
    },
