      "completion_evidence": "verification/TURN_164_CONSERVATION_COMPLETION.json",
      "verified_scope": "ConservationLedger exact original nonempty duplicate-free support and unique total map guards/errors; complete source-order position pairs from EncodingLoss. Empty strings and literal empty-One labels stay admitted.; Exact five-field ledger with source support, first-use image support, complete retained/closed pairs or empty-One and complete predecessor fibres. Native pair membership iff, disjoint exhaustive accounting and closed pair iff common image fibre.; ConservationComposition exact source/middle validation, source-order composed map and original first-ledger/compose/composite-ledger error order. Native lookup composition, composite admission, preservation of closed pairs, retained subset and admitted law true. List membership implements exact set subset semantics; no new guard.; ConservationReverse retains exact original distinct dictionary-image count equals source-count test. ConservationCardinality proves its equivalence to source injectivity and exactly singleton predecessor fibres, using native dictionary/source-image correspondence and distinct-image cardinality proofs.; Exact original fibre order and singleton source string versus held-predecessor-labels complete list. Native output membership, singleton/held iff, unique recovery, held-label provenance and exclusion of a unique inverse across two distinct predecessors.; ConservationExtension singleton full record; general fresh-source admission and fibre update; source-order complete pair successor and retained/closed membership iff old classified pair or new old/fresh pair with exact image comparison. No finite-depth cutoff.; Full original1024 ten-axis product and complete source order/IDs/forms/reasons, exhaustive enumeration, sole survivor and rejection of each alternative coordinate. All five original operational witnesses pass native proof; all laws, induction, exclusions and controls retained.; Fresh native registration/census/all1024 actual candidate lookups/closure/controls/hash/unknown-ID outputs match pinned V3. Verbatim original why, derivation, check, limitations and correspondence terms retained."
    }
